WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.950
Lab 1, after listing the reads
and collecting the pilot.

2
00:00:03.950 --> 00:00:07.037
Step 3 reads the
connectors group by group.

3
00:00:07.037 --> 00:00:10.387
Headquarters has two active
connectors on the current version.

4
00:00:10.387 --> 00:00:15.037
The cloud group has one active and one
inactive, and the active one is old.

5
00:00:15.037 --> 00:00:16.825
Step 4 runs the checks.

6
00:00:16.825 --> 00:00:18.675
Both connector problems fail.

7
00:00:18.675 --> 00:00:23.363
The Finance app is a slash sixteen
on every port, assigned to a person,

8
00:00:23.363 --> 00:00:27.800
under an enforced policy that
doesn't exclude emergency access.

9
00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:32.200
Because every port includes RDP,
it's an administrative path too.

10
00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:35.488
The RDP app asks only for MFA.

11
00:00:35.488 --> 00:00:38.230
And Quick Access still holds two segments.
